    "contents/hobby.md": "- Anime & Manga\n- Cycling\n- TCG",
    "contents/home.md": "I am a Ph.D. student in Software Engineering at Zhejiang University, where I began my doctoral studies in 2025. From 2024 to 2025, I worked as a research assistant in [Menglin Yang](https://yangmenglinsite.github.io/)'s group at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (Guangzhou).\n\nMy research interests include deep learning, data mining, recommender systems, and hyperbolic graph neural networks. My recent work explores physiology-informed learning for muscle fatigue assessment.\n",
    "contents/patents.md": "\u003carticle class=\"patent-item\">\n    \u003ch3>A Knowledge Perception Recommendation Method for Multiple Hyperbolic Spaces\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cp lang=\"zh-CN\">一种多双曲空间的知识感知推荐方法\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-authors\">\u003cstrong>Tong Zhang\u003c/strong>, Y. Kong, L. Zhang, and B. Yin\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"patent-meta\">Published and awaiting examination · CN 117973535 A · May 3, 2024\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-links\">\n        \u003ca href=\"document/20242036.pdf\">Patent document\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n\u003c/article>\n\n\u003carticle class=\"patent-item\">\n    \u003ch3>A Global Hyperbolic Embedding-Based Method for Multi-Intent Detection and Semantic Slot Filling\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cp lang=\"zh-CN\">一种基于全局双曲嵌入的多意图检测与语义槽位填充方法\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-authors\">Y. Kong, \u003cstrong>Tong Zhang\u003c/strong>, L. Zhang, and B. Yin\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"patent-meta\">Published and awaiting examination · CN 117932065 A · April 26, 2024\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-links\">\n        \u003ca href=\"document/20242037.pdf\">Patent document\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/zasuji/Multi-Intent-Detection-and-Semantic-Slot-Filling\">Code\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n\u003c/article>\n",
    "contents/publications.md": "\u003carticle class=\"publication-card featured\" data-kind=\"preprint\" id=\"fatigueformer\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-meta\">\u003cspan>2026\u003c/span>\u003cspan>arXiv preprint\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003ch3>FatigueFormer: A Physiology-Informed Model for Upper-Limb Muscle Fatigue Assessment\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-authors\">\u003cstrong>Tong Zhang\u003c/strong>, Hong Guo, Shuangzhou Yan, Dongkai Weng, Jian Wang, and Hongxin Zhang\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-summary\">A physiology-informed model that groups surface electromyography features by fatigue-related trends to assess upper-limb muscle fatigue across individuals and contraction intensities.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdetails class=\"paper-abstract\">\n        \u003csummary>Research overview\u003c/summary>\n        \u003cp>The model separates sEMG measurements according to how they change with fatigue, then learns from relationships within each time window and across windows. Experiments use perceived exertion as a fatigue label, compare generalization to unseen participants, and include a second dataset for external validation.\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/details>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-links\">\n        \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.26841\">arXiv:2603.26841\u003c/a>\n        \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.26841\">PDF\u003c/a>\n        \u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"copy-citation\" data-copy-citation=\"fatigueformer\">Copy BibTeX\u003c/button>\n        \u003cspan class=\"citation-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n\u003c/article>\n\n\u003carticle class=\"publication-card\" data-kind=\"manuscript\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-meta\">\u003cspan>2024\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Manuscript · Under review\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003ch3>Hyperbolic Distance Discerns Knowledge-Guided Users\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-authors\">\u003cstrong>Tong Zhang\u003c/strong>, Y. Gao, Y. Kong, L. Zhang, and B. Yin\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-links\">\n        \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/zasuji/DHN-2024\">Code\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n\u003c/article>\n\n\u003carticle class=\"publication-card\" data-kind=\"conference\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-meta\">\u003cspan>2021\u003c/span>\u003cspan>GDC 2021\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003ch3>Point Cloud Oriented Normal Solution Based on Global Guidance\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-authors\">\u003cstrong>Tong Zhang\u003c/strong>, S. Wang, J. Cao, and X. Liu\u003c/p>\n    \u003cp class=\"publication-summary\">\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\">基于全局指导的点云定向法向求解\u003c/span> · The 13th National Conference on Geometric Design and Computation\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"publication-links\">\n        \u003ca href=\"document/poster.pdf\">Poster\u003c/a>\n    \u003c/div>\n\u003c/article>\n",
